wrote:

> On 02/09/18 18:13, Sahil Arora wrote:
> > [....] I searched a bit and found that
> > Docusaurus <https://docusaurus.io/> is a great tool which might help us
> > make a maintainable and good-looking website for our purpose. [....]
>
> Looks nice. Also an easy news blog is possible (similar to the on on
> GitHub).
>
> Important is to check whether
>
> - docusaurus itself is free software and does not pull in any non-free
>    dependencies
>
> - docusaurus is maintained and under active development
>
> Please check these two points.
>

Before you make a final decision, please be aware and take into account that
docusaurus seems to be a Facebook-controlled software project:

* https://github.com/facebook/Docusaurus

License is MIT. Active development is a given:

* https://github.com/facebook/Docusaurus/graphs/contributors

